{"ID":"20240205153747-46jbw9t","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153747-46jbw9t","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153747-46jbw9t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105444-ozgtoyp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611142132-wlfj57u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611142547-oec4xhp\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"167瞿麦（巨句麦）","type":"doc","updated":"20240814091359"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206105444-ozgtoyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105444-ozgtoyp","updated":"20240206105452"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、河北、东北等地。\n【性状】\t石竹：茎直立，圆形，有分枝，长3050cm；完整叶条状披针形，长29cm，宽27mm；萼筒长12cm，约为全花的1/2；萼下有数枚小苞片，长约为萼筒的1/2，先端尾状渐尖，覆瓦状排列；有时可见皱缩的花瓣，棕紫色或棕黄色，先端浅裂呈锯齿状。茎质硬脆，折断面中空。气弱，味微甜。\n瞿麦：茎圆柱形，长3060cm，节部膨大；表面淡绿色或黄绿色，略有光泽，无毛。叶多皱缩，对生，黄绿色，展平后叶片长条披针形，长27cm，宽14mm；叶尖稍反卷，基部短鞘状抱茎。花棕紫色或棕黄色，长34cm，单生或数朵簇生；具宿萼，萼筒长2.5"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.5cm，约为全花的3/4；萼下有小苞片，长约为萼筒的1/4，先端急尖或渐尖，外表有规则的纵纹；花瓣先端深裂呈流苏状。茎质硬脆，折断面中空。气无，味甘。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t利尿通淋，破血通经。用于热淋、血淋、石淋、小便不通、淋沥涩痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240206105444-9gqihzq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105444-9gqihzq","updated":"20240206105444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206105444-vqe5fgj.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205161414-u3442m4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205161414-u3442m4","updated":"20240814090721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 650px;","style":"width: 640px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瞿麦"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/瞿麦-20240205161414-df8vzwf.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 640px;\" parent-style=\"width: 650px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814090704-tfx0spv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814090704-tfx0spv","updated":"20240814090705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 363px;","style":"width: 353px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"翟麦 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/翟麦 1-20240814090705-3bzqqil.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 353px;\" parent-style=\"width: 363px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 324px;","style":"width: 314px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"翟麦"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/翟麦-20240814090621-lgyf0rp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 314px;\" parent-style=\"width: 324px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624150141-5ap7dzh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624150141-5ap7dzh","updated":"20240814091359"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 628px;","style":"width: 618px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"瞿麦3"},{"T